        "id": "bondOfLife",
        "name": "Crimson Moon’s Semblance · bond Of Life",
        "source": "Weapon",
        "category": "weapon",
        "defaultEnabled": true,
        "description": "Grants a Bond of Life equal to 25% of Max HP when a Charged Attack hits an opponent. This effect can be triggered up to once every 14s. In addition, when the equipping character has a Bond of Life, they gain a 12%/16%/20%/24%/28% DMG Bonus; if the value of the Bond of Life is greater than or equal to 30% of Max HP, then gain an additional 24%/32%/40%/48%/56% DMG Bonus. Combat snapshot: set the controls for this hit; durations, stack consumption, healing, energy and cooldowns are not simulated.",
